{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05759","headline":"乡试後自巩还田家因谢邻友见过之作 · 卢象","name":"乡试後自巩还田家因谢邻友见过之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡鸣出东邑，马倦登南峦。\n落日见桑柘，翳然丘中寒。\n邻家多旧识，投暝来相看。\n且问春税苦，兼陈行路难。\n园场近阴壑，草木易凋残。\n峰晴雪犹积，涧深冰已团。\n浮名知何用，岁晏不成欢。\n置酒共君饮，当歌聊自宽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}